	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Ego reverende in Christo pater iam semel atque itrum
					<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scripsi. Priores dederam homini indigenae agri vestri
